/E (By completing this project, I have demonstrated essential Data Engineering skills for working with modern cloud databases. The NextWork database is now fully provisioned and populated, and I have validated that all necessary data access and modification patterns are functional, proving that the AWS CLI within AWS CloudShell is a powerful and efficient tool for managing NoSQL infrastructure and data lifecycle.)
